<title> Dehydration: Management.</title>
<graphic href="eee0122-w001.gif" />
<cell type="start" id="cell-1">
<label>Dehydration suspected in an adult. Order urinalysis, BUN, serum creatinine, and serum sodium.</label>
<path target="cell-2">Hypernatremia, increased urine specific gravity</path>
<path target="cell-3">Normal sodium, increased BUN/creatinine ratio</path>
<path target="cell-4">Hyponatremia, decreased urine specific gravity</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-2">
<label>Hypertonic dehydration. Hemodynamically unstable patient?</label>
<path target="cell-5">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-6">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-5">
<label>Replace with intravenous normal saline.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-6">
<label>Replace with half normal saline, orally if possible but intravenously, if necessary.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-3">
<label>Isotonic dehydration.</label>
<path target="cell-6"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-4">
<label>Hypotonic dehydration.</label>
<path target="cell-7"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-7">
<label>Replace with normal saline, orally if possible but intravenously, if necessary.</label>
</cell>
</algorithm>
</algorithms>
